Error [E2712]: `$` splice used outside a comptime context
  --> tests/ui/E2712_splice_outside_comptime.jet:8:11
    |
  8 |     print($x)
    |           ^^
 Why: `$name` looks up a name in the comptime scope and is only valid inside a `derive` body, `comptime {}` block, or comptime binding
 Fix: remove the `$` prefix, or move this code into a `comptime { … }` block or a `derive` body
